Files: tokens.css, materials.css, motion.css

Consumption rule (from the design repo README):
将所需文件以确定版本纳入产品，保留其同级关系；
不引用可变的默认分支作为生产设计依赖。
原始品牌色与核心语言不得修改；本目录文件请勿就地改动数值。

Consumer: yumema / 梦间 (ai-companion), renderer (Electron + React + Vite).
Entry: src/renderer/styles/globals.css imports these files in order
(tokens.css → materials.css → motion.css); LICENSE is kept alongside.
